\ The scope: a bouncing button on PC13, traced  ok.
#!attach 2 switch PC13 bounce=2000
#!trace PC13
#!scope
+0 us PC13 -1 mV
$48000800 constant GPIOC  ok.
%100 $4002104C bis!  ok.
%11 26 lshift GPIOC bic!  ok.
%01 26 lshift GPIOC $0C + bis!  ok.
#!scope
+0 us PC13 3300 mV
#!input 2 1
: wait 0 do loop ; 20000 wait  ok.
#!scope
+0 us PC13 0 mV
+172 us PC13 3300 mV
+543 us PC13 0 mV
+787 us PC13 3300 mV
+970 us PC13 0 mV
+1287 us PC13 3300 mV
+1428 us PC13 0 mV
